{"v":1,"book":"Ps","ch":35,"verses":[{"n":0,"text":"Of David","tok":[{"t":"Of "},{"t":"David","s":["H1732"],"a":[0]}]},{"n":1,"text":"Strive, O Jehovah, with those who strive with me; Battle against those who battle against me.","tok":[{"t":"Strive, O "},{"t":"Jehovah","s":["H3068"],"a":[1]},{"t":", with those who "},{"t":"strive","s":["H3401"],"a":[3]},{"t":" with me; Battle against those who battle against me."}]},{"n":2,"text":"Take hold of buckler and shield, And rise up as my help.","tok":[{"t":"Take "},{"t":"hold","s":["H2388"],"a":[0]},{"t":" of "},{"t":"buckler","s":["H6793"],"a":[2]},{"t":" and "},{"t":"shield","s":["H4043"],"a":[1]},{"t":", And "},{"t":"rise","s":["H6793"],"a":[2]},{"t":" "},{"t":"up","s":["H6965"],"a":[3]},{"t":" as my "},{"t":"help","s":["H5833"],"a":[4]},{"t":"."}]},{"n":3,"text":"Draw out also the spear, and close up the way Against those who pursue me; Say to my soul, I am your salvation.","tok":[{"t":"Draw "},{"t":"out","s":["H7324"],"a":[0]},{"t":" also the "},{"t":"spear","s":["H2595"],"a":[1]},{"t":", and close up the way "},{"t":"Against","s":["H7125"]},{"t":" those who pursue me; "},{"t":"Say","s":["H0559"],"a":[5]},{"t":" to my "},{"t":"soul","s":["H5315"],"a":[6]},{"t":", I am your "},{"t":"salvation","s":["H3444"],"a":[7]},{"t":"."}]},{"n":4,"text":"Let those who seek my life Be put to shame and humiliated; Let those who devise evil for me Be turned back and confounded.","tok":[{"t":"Let those who "},{"t":"seek","s":["H1245"],"a":[2]},{"t":" my life Be put to "},{"t":"shame","s":["H3637"],"a":[1]},{"t":" and humiliated; Let those who "},{"t":"devise","s":["H2803"],"a":[7]},{"t":" evil for me Be "},{"t":"turned","s":["H5472"],"a":[4]},{"t":" "},{"t":"back","s":["H0268"],"a":[5]},{"t":" and confounded."}]},{"n":5,"text":"Let them be like chaff before the wind, With the angel of Jehovah driving them on.","tok":[{"t":"Let them be like "},{"t":"chaff","s":["H4671"],"a":[1]},{"t":" "},{"t":"before","s":["H6440"],"a":[2]},{"t":" the "},{"t":"wind","s":["H7307"],"a":[3]},{"t":", With the "},{"t":"angel","s":["H4397"],"a":[4]},{"t":" of "},{"t":"Jehovah","s":["H3068"],"a":[5]},{"t":" driving them on."}]},{"n":6,"text":"Let their way be darkness and slipperiness itself, With the angel of Jehovah pursuing them.","tok":[{"t":"Let their "},{"t":"way","s":["H1870"],"a":[1]},{"t":" be darkness and slipperiness itself, With the "},{"t":"angel","s":["H4397"],"a":[4]},{"t":" of "},{"t":"Jehovah","s":["H3068"],"a":[5]},{"t":" pursuing them."}]},{"n":7,"text":"For without cause they hid their net for me; Without cause they dug a pit for me.","tok":[{"t":"For without "},{"t":"cause","s":["H2600"],"a":[1]},{"t":" they "},{"t":"hid","s":["H2934"],"a":[2]},{"t":" their "},{"t":"net","s":["H7568"],"a":[5]},{"t":" for me; Without "},{"t":"cause","s":["H2600"],"a":[6]},{"t":" they dug a "},{"t":"pit","s":["H7845"],"a":[4]},{"t":" for me."}]},{"n":8,"text":"Let destruction come upon him unawares, And let his net, which he hid, catch him; Let him fall into it, into destruction.","tok":[{"t":"Let "},{"t":"destruction","s":["H7722"],"a":[1]},{"t":" "},{"t":"come","s":["H0935"],"a":[0]},{"t":" upon him "},{"t":"unawares","s":["H3045"],"a":[3]},{"t":", And let his "},{"t":"net","s":["H7568"],"a":[4]},{"t":", which he "},{"t":"hid","s":["H2934"],"a":[6]},{"t":", "},{"t":"catch","s":["H3920"],"a":[7]},{"t":" him; Let him "},{"t":"fall","s":["H5307"],"a":[9]},{"t":" into it, into "},{"t":"destruction","s":["H7722"],"a":[8]},{"t":"."}]},{"n":9,"text":"Then my soul will exult in Jehovah; It will rejoice in His salvation.","tok":[{"t":"Then my "},{"t":"soul","s":["H5315"],"a":[0]},{"t":" will exult in "},{"t":"Jehovah","s":["H3068"],"a":[2]},{"t":"; It will "},{"t":"rejoice","s":["H7797"],"a":[3]},{"t":" in His "},{"t":"salvation","s":["H3444"],"a":[4]},{"t":"."}]},{"n":10,"text":"All my bones will say, Jehovah, who is like You, Who delivers the poor from him who is too strong for him, And the poor and needy from him who robs him?","tok":[{"t":"All my "},{"t":"bones","s":["H6106"],"a":[1]},{"t":" will "},{"t":"say","s":["H0559"],"a":[2]},{"t":", "},{"t":"Jehovah","s":["H3068"],"a":[3]},{"t":", who is like You, Who "},{"t":"delivers","s":["H5337"],"a":[6]},{"t":" the "},{"t":"poor","s":["H6041"],"a":[7]},{"t":" from him who is too "},{"t":"strong","s":["H2389"],"a":[8]},{"t":" for him, And the "},{"t":"poor","s":["H6041"],"a":[10]},{"t":" and "},{"t":"needy","s":["H0034"],"a":[11]},{"t":" from him who robs him?"}]},{"n":11,"text":"Malicious witnesses rise up; They ask me about things I know nothing of.","tok":[{"t":"Malicious","s":["H2555"],"a":[2]},{"t":" "},{"t":"witnesses","s":["H5707"],"a":[1]},{"t":" rise "},{"t":"up","s":["H6965"],"a":[0]},{"t":"; They ask me about things I know nothing of."}]},{"n":12,"text":"They repay me evil for good; I am bereaved in soul.","tok":[{"t":"They repay me "},{"t":"evil","s":["H7451"],"a":[1]},{"t":" for "},{"t":"good","s":["H2896"],"a":[3]},{"t":"; I am bereaved in "},{"t":"soul","s":["H5315"],"a":[5]},{"t":"."}]},{"n":13,"text":"But I, when they were sick, Had sackcloth as my clothing; I afflicted my soul with fasting, And my prayer returned to my own bosom.","tok":[{"t":"But I, when they were "},{"t":"sick","s":["H2470"],"a":[1]},{"t":", "},{"t":"Had","s":["H3830"],"a":[2]},{"t":" "},{"t":"sackcloth","s":["H8242"],"a":[3]},{"t":" as my "},{"t":"clothing","s":["H3830"],"a":[2]},{"t":"; I afflicted my "},{"t":"soul","s":["H5315"],"a":[6]},{"t":" with "},{"t":"fasting","s":["H6685"],"a":[5]},{"t":", And my "},{"t":"prayer","s":["H8605"],"a":[7]},{"t":" "},{"t":"returned","s":["H7725"],"a":[10]},{"t":" to my own "},{"t":"bosom","s":["H2436"],"a":[9]},{"t":"."}]},{"n":14,"text":"I conducted myself as if it had been my friend or my brother; Like one mourning for his mother, I bowed down gloomily.","tok":[{"t":"I conducted myself as if it had been my "},{"t":"friend","s":["H7453"],"a":[0]},{"t":" or my "},{"t":"brother","s":["H0251"],"a":[1]},{"t":"; Like one "},{"t":"mourning","s":["H0057"],"a":[4]},{"t":" for his "},{"t":"mother","s":["H0517"],"a":[5]},{"t":", I bowed "},{"t":"down","s":["H7817"],"a":[7]},{"t":" gloomily."}]},{"n":15,"text":"But at my stumbling they rejoice and gather together; The attackers whom I did not know Gather together against me; They tear at me and do not cease.","tok":[{"t":"But at my stumbling they "},{"t":"rejoice","s":["H8055"],"a":[1]},{"t":" and gather "},{"t":"together","s":["H0622"],"a":[2]},{"t":"; The attackers whom I did not know Gather "},{"t":"together","s":["H0622"],"a":[3]},{"t":" against me; They "},{"t":"tear","s":["H7167"],"a":[8]},{"t":" at me and do not "},{"t":"cease","s":["H1826"],"a":[10]},{"t":"."}]},{"n":16,"text":"As profane mocking parasites, They gnash their teeth at me.","tok":[{"t":"As profane mocking parasites, They "},{"t":"gnash","s":["H2786"],"a":[3]},{"t":" their "},{"t":"teeth","s":["H8127"],"a":[5]},{"t":" at me."}]},{"n":17,"text":"O Lord, how long will You look on? Rescue my soul from their destruction, My precious life from the lions.","tok":[{"t":"O "},{"t":"Lord","s":["H0136"],"a":[0]},{"t":", how long will You look "},{"t":"on","s":["H7200"],"a":[2]},{"t":"? "},{"t":"Rescue","s":["H7725"],"a":[3]},{"t":" my "},{"t":"soul","s":["H5315"],"a":[4]},{"t":" from their "},{"t":"destruction","s":["H7722"],"a":[5]},{"t":", My precious life from the "},{"t":"lions","s":["H3715"],"a":[6]},{"t":"."}]},{"n":18,"text":"I will give You thanks in the great congregation; Among a mighty people I will praise You.","tok":[{"t":"I will give You "},{"t":"thanks","s":["H3034"],"a":[0]},{"t":" in the "},{"t":"great","s":["H7227"],"a":[2]},{"t":" "},{"t":"congregation","s":["H6951"],"a":[1]},{"t":"; Among a mighty "},{"t":"people","s":["H5971"],"a":[3]},{"t":" I will "},{"t":"praise","s":["H1984"],"a":[5]},{"t":" You."}]},{"n":19,"text":"Do not let those who are wrongly my enemies rejoice over me; Do not let those who hate me without cause narrow their eyes at me.","tok":[{"t":"Do not let those who are wrongly my "},{"t":"enemies","s":["H0341"],"a":[3]},{"t":" "},{"t":"rejoice","s":["H8055"],"a":[1]},{"t":" over me; Do not let those who "},{"t":"hate","s":["H8130"],"a":[5]},{"t":" me without "},{"t":"cause","s":["H2600"],"a":[6]},{"t":" narrow their eyes at me."}]},{"n":20,"text":"For they do not speak peace, But devise words of deceit Against the quiet people of the land.","tok":[{"t":"For they do not "},{"t":"speak","s":["H1696"],"a":[3]},{"t":" "},{"t":"peace","s":["H7965"],"a":[2]},{"t":", But "},{"t":"devise","s":["H2803"],"a":[9]},{"t":" words of deceit Against the "},{"t":"quiet","s":["H7282"],"a":[5]},{"t":" people of the "},{"t":"land","s":["H0776"],"a":[6]},{"t":"."}]},{"n":21,"text":"And they open their mouth wide against me; They say, Aha! Aha! Our eyes have seen it.","tok":[{"t":"And they open their "},{"t":"mouth","s":["H6310"],"a":[2]},{"t":" "},{"t":"wide","s":["H7337"],"a":[0]},{"t":" against me; They say, "},{"t":"Aha","s":["H1889"],"a":[4]},{"t":"! "},{"t":"Aha","s":["H1889"],"a":[5]},{"t":"! Our eyes have "},{"t":"seen","s":["H7200"],"a":[6]},{"t":" it."}]},{"n":22,"text":"You have seen, O Jehovah; do not be silent. O Lord, do not be far from me.","tok":[{"t":"You have "},{"t":"seen","s":["H7200"],"a":[0]},{"t":", O "},{"t":"Jehovah","s":["H3068"],"a":[1]},{"t":"; do not be silent. O "},{"t":"Lord","s":["H0136"],"a":[4]},{"t":", do not be "},{"t":"far","s":["H7368"],"a":[6]},{"t":" from me."}]},{"n":23,"text":"Awake, and stir Yourself for my cause, For my claim, O my God and my Lord.","tok":[{"t":"Awake","s":["H6974"],"a":[1]},{"t":", and stir Yourself for my "},{"t":"cause","s":["H7379"],"a":[5]},{"t":", For my claim, O my "},{"t":"God","s":["H0430"],"a":[3]},{"t":" and my "},{"t":"Lord","s":["H0136"],"a":[4]},{"t":"."}]},{"n":24,"text":"Vindicate me according to Your righteousness, O Jehovah my God; And do not let them rejoice over me.","tok":[{"t":"Vindicate me according to Your "},{"t":"righteousness","s":["H6664"],"a":[1]},{"t":", O "},{"t":"Jehovah","s":["H3068"],"a":[2]},{"t":" my "},{"t":"God","s":["H0430"],"a":[3]},{"t":"; And do not let them "},{"t":"rejoice","s":["H8055"],"a":[5]},{"t":" over me."}]},{"n":25,"text":"Do not let them say in their heart, Aha! That is what we wanted. Do not let them say, We have swallowed him up.","tok":[{"t":"Do not let them "},{"t":"say","s":["H0559"],"a":[1]},{"t":" in their "},{"t":"heart","s":["H3820"],"a":[2]},{"t":", Aha! That is what we wanted. Do not let them "},{"t":"say","s":["H0559"],"a":[6]},{"t":", We have swallowed him "},{"t":"up","s":["H1104"],"a":[7]},{"t":"."}]},{"n":26,"text":"May those who rejoice at my trouble Be ashamed and confounded together; May those who magnify themselves against me Be clothed with shame and humiliation.","tok":[{"t":"May those who "},{"t":"rejoice","s":["H8056"],"a":[3]},{"t":" at my trouble Be "},{"t":"ashamed","s":["H0954"],"a":[0]},{"t":" and "},{"t":"confounded","s":["H2659"],"a":[1]},{"t":" "},{"t":"together","s":["H3162"],"a":[2]},{"t":"; May those who "},{"t":"magnify","s":["H1431"],"a":[8]},{"t":" themselves against me Be "},{"t":"clothed","s":["H3847"],"a":[5]},{"t":" with "},{"t":"shame","s":["H1322"],"a":[6]},{"t":" and humiliation."}]},{"n":27,"text":"May those who delight in the vindication of my righteousness Give a ringing shout and rejoice, And may they say continually, Jehovah be magnified, Who delights in the well-being of His servant.","tok":[{"t":"May those who delight in the vindication of my righteousness Give a ringing shout and rejoice, And may they "},{"t":"say","s":["H0559"],"a":[4]},{"t":" "},{"t":"continually","s":["H8548"],"a":[5]},{"t":", "},{"t":"Jehovah","s":["H3068"],"a":[7]},{"t":" be "},{"t":"magnified","s":["H1431"],"a":[6]},{"t":", Who delights in the well-being of His "},{"t":"servant","s":["H5650"],"a":[10]},{"t":"."}]},{"n":28,"text":"And my tongue will declare Your righteousness And Your praise all day long.","tok":[{"t":"And my "},{"t":"tongue","s":["H3956"],"a":[0]},{"t":" will declare Your "},{"t":"righteousness","s":["H6664"],"a":[2]},{"t":" And Your "},{"t":"praise","s":["H8416"],"a":[5]},{"t":" all "},{"t":"day","s":["H3117"],"a":[4]},{"t":" long."}]}]}
